// user called the node in their workflow, so it is the one to show them.
// Everything but “id“ is optional. The identity is read from the live workflow
// tables and, when those cannot answer, from the job's own spec; a job old enough
// to predate the spec layouts leaves all three null, and a response that failed on
// an unnamed node would take the failure list away at the moment it is needed.
